&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE openQueryCodigo DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE openQueryCodigo :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
 
 OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} 
      FOR EACH {&tableName}
         WHERE {&tablename}.cod-layout >= c-cod-layout-ini
           AND {&tablename}.cod-layout <= c-cod-layout-fim NO-LOCK INDEXED-REPOSITION.

 RETURN "OK":U.
         
END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME


